    "A 3-byte integer, signed range is -8,388,608 to 8,388,607, unsigned range is 0 to 16,777,215": "3 字节整数，有符号范围为 -8,388,608 至 8,388,607，无符号范围为 0 至 16,777,215",
    "A 4-byte integer, signed range is -2,147,483,648 to 2,147,483,647, unsigned range is 0 to 4,294,967,295": "4 字节整数，有符号范围为 -2,147,483,648 至 2,147,483,647，无符号范围为 0 至 4,294,967,295",
