    "A BLOB column with a maximum length of 65,535 (2^16 - 1) bytes, stored with a two-byte prefix indicating the length of the value": "BLOB 列，最大长度为 65,535 (2^16 - 1) 字节，存储时使用二字节前缀表示值的长度",
