    "A TEXT column with a maximum length of 255 (2^8 - 1) characters, stored with a one-byte prefix indicating the length of the value in bytes": "TEXT 列，最大长度为 255 (2^8 - 1) 个字符，存储时使用一字节前缀表示值的字节长度",
